            "reviewBody": "Needed to increase the proportions to have enough. Our family really likes it! Recommend combining the corn starch with just a bit of cold water before adding it to the raisin mix to keep from getting clumps. And I did increase the amount to almost 2 tsp to get any thickness to the sauce. Also recommend letting the water boil before adding the raisins, not sure why but it did make a difference as the recipe calls for",
